WEBVTT

00:02.836 --> 00:08.299
Over a century ago, beings that prey
on humans suddenly appeared.

00:13.972 --> 00:18.935
Their overwhelming strength

00:19.394 --> 00:23.273
quickly pushed humanity
to the brink of extinction.

00:27.694 --> 00:34.117
The surviving humans constructed
three walls, Maria, Rose, and Sina,

00:34.200 --> 00:37.245
which brought them a century of peace.

00:37.829 --> 00:38.747
However...

00:39.914 --> 00:45.587
in the year 845, the Colossal Titan

00:45.754 --> 00:48.173
and the Armored Titan suddenly appeared.

00:48.256 --> 00:52.260
They destroyed one of humanity's walls,
and with it, everyday life.

00:54.888 --> 00:57.432
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

00:58.141 --> 01:01.436
lost twenty percent of its population
and a third of its territory,

01:01.853 --> 01:05.940
and was forced to retreat
behind Wall Rose.

01:09.402 --> 01:10.820
In the year 850,

01:12.072 --> 01:16.743
the Colossal Titan reappeared
and demolished another wall,

01:17.243 --> 01:19.913
and allowed the Titans inside once again.

01:21.873 --> 01:22.791
Eren!

01:23.333 --> 01:24.250
Hurry!

01:31.216 --> 01:35.720
The entire populace was evacuated
two hours later.

01:36.846 --> 01:39.516
Not a single person
was eaten by a Titan...

01:40.892 --> 01:45.980
save for the soldiers who fended them off
and died in the line of duty.

01:46.856 --> 01:47.690
Eren.

01:48.274 --> 01:51.778
As long as I have you, I can do anything.

03:34.672 --> 03:36.090
Please wait, Captain!

03:36.841 --> 03:38.468
Should the Titans attack,

03:38.760 --> 03:41.888
we supply soldiers won't be able to
hold this position on our own!

03:42.388 --> 03:44.849
Please, sir! You have to stay here!

03:44.933 --> 03:46.392
Step aside.

03:46.726 --> 03:50.939
I must reorganize the reinforcements now.

03:52.148 --> 03:54.901
Behind the safety
of the inner gate, you mean?

03:55.735 --> 03:57.779
What the hell are you trying to say?

03:58.154 --> 04:00.114
I'll have you know,
I'm following regulations!

04:00.198 --> 04:03.826
Obeying established regulations
is a soldier's duty!

04:03.910 --> 04:05.870
But, sir, if we lose this position...

04:05.954 --> 04:07.705
Enough!

04:09.332 --> 04:10.625
Open your mouth again

04:10.708 --> 04:14.379
and I'll be forced to sentence you
for treason where you stand!

04:28.017 --> 04:31.187
Why isn't anyone going over the wall?

04:31.521 --> 04:33.773
I'm sure they heard the bell
signaling us to withdraw...

04:48.997 --> 04:50.832
It's all over...

04:52.000 --> 04:53.001
We're done for.

05:03.511 --> 05:04.345
There!

05:05.013 --> 05:07.932
What good is that going to do?

05:17.525 --> 05:19.485
Come on, Jean! What are we going to do?

05:19.902 --> 05:21.946
There's nothing we can do.

05:22.613 --> 05:24.824
They finally gave the order to withdraw,

05:24.949 --> 05:27.076
but we don't have enough gas
to scale the wall.

05:27.910 --> 05:30.330
We're all going to die...

05:30.705 --> 05:32.790
all because of those cowards.

05:33.541 --> 05:35.084
You mean the supply soldiers?

05:35.626 --> 05:38.463
What has happened to them?
Were they wiped out?

05:38.921 --> 05:41.299
Apparently, they lost the will to fight.

05:41.758 --> 05:43.384
I can understand how they feel,

05:43.968 --> 05:45.511
but abandoning their duty to supply us

05:45.595 --> 05:48.014
so they can barricade themselves
inside HQ?

05:48.973 --> 05:51.392
Sure enough,
Titans have swarmed the place,

05:51.476 --> 05:53.394
meaning we can't even
get gas for ourselves.

05:53.561 --> 05:55.438
In that case, it's sink or swim!

05:55.521 --> 05:57.648
We'll just have to take out
the Titans there!

05:58.149 --> 06:02.445
Hanging around here's no different!
The Titans will just gather here too!

06:03.321 --> 06:07.408
We'll only use up what little gas
we have left if we keep running aimlessly!

06:07.533 --> 06:10.495
Once we lose our mobility,
we're really done for!

06:11.537 --> 06:14.207
You're actually using your head
for once, Conny.

06:15.249 --> 06:18.836
But do you really think we have
the manpower to pull that off?

06:19.504 --> 06:22.090
Most of the veteran members of
the vanguard have been wiped out.

06:22.882 --> 06:24.092
We're just cadets.

06:24.175 --> 06:27.095
Who can possibly take charge
of a suicide mission like that?

06:28.262 --> 06:30.348
Even if someone could,

06:30.431 --> 06:32.725
it's not like we would stand a chance
against the Titans.

06:33.559 --> 06:38.689
And the supply room's probably got some
that are three or four meters high.

06:39.357 --> 06:42.151
There's no way we could get
anything done in there.

06:44.654 --> 06:45.822
So it's hopeless?

06:47.240 --> 06:49.450
What a dull life this was.

06:49.992 --> 06:52.453
If I had known this would happen,
I would've said something sooner...

06:53.663 --> 06:55.498
Come on, guys! Let's do it!

06:55.915 --> 06:57.125
Get up!

06:57.208 --> 07:00.753
If we all work together,
we're sure to succeed!

07:00.837 --> 07:02.797
I'll take the lead!

07:13.766 --> 07:15.601
Armin! Let's go...

07:22.900 --> 07:23.818
Reiner.

07:24.068 --> 07:24.986
What now?

07:25.069 --> 07:27.947
Not yet. We have to let them gather first.

07:28.614 --> 07:29.782
It's no use...

07:30.908 --> 07:33.995
No matter how you look at it,
we're not getting out of this city.

07:34.078 --> 07:35.705
We're all dead.

07:36.664 --> 07:39.208
I mean, I'm ready to die and everything...

07:39.917 --> 07:43.421
It's just... What am I dying for?

07:44.338 --> 07:45.256
Mikasa!

07:45.631 --> 07:47.175
Weren't you with the rearguard?

07:47.592 --> 07:48.509
Annie!

07:49.719 --> 07:51.596
I understand the gist of the situation.

07:51.721 --> 07:54.724
So I'm sorry for letting
my personal matters interfere,

07:54.891 --> 07:56.767
but have you seen Eren's squad?

07:57.101 --> 08:00.271
I haven't, but some squads did
make it over the wall...

08:00.354 --> 08:02.648
Actually, we did find Armin over there.

08:04.901 --> 08:05.902
Armin!

08:07.236 --> 08:08.237
Mikasa...

08:08.905 --> 08:12.825
No! I can't bring myself to face her!

08:13.367 --> 08:15.786
All I did was survive
for no good reason...

08:16.454 --> 08:17.872
If I had known that this would happen...

08:18.873 --> 08:21.417
I would rather have died with him instead!

08:23.503 --> 08:24.504
Armin.

08:24.587 --> 08:27.548
You're not hurt, are you?
Are you all right?

08:34.138 --> 08:35.348
Where's Eren?

08:38.142 --> 08:39.060
Armin?

08:50.821 --> 08:52.073
We...

08:53.824 --> 08:56.536
The cadets of Squad 34,

08:57.078 --> 08:58.454
Thomas Wagner,

08:58.913 --> 09:00.164
Nack Tierce,

09:00.915 --> 09:02.625
Milieus Zeremski,

09:03.543 --> 09:05.294
Mina Carolina,

09:05.962 --> 09:07.672
Eren Jaeger...

09:08.631 --> 09:09.882
These five members

09:10.341 --> 09:12.385
fulfilled their duties

09:13.052 --> 09:15.596
and died valiantly on the field of battle!

09:18.683 --> 09:20.017
You can't be serious...

09:21.769 --> 09:24.605
So, Squad 34 is basically gone?

09:25.273 --> 09:28.401
The same thing will happen to us
if we try to take on the Titans.

09:29.735 --> 09:31.571
I'm sorry, Mikasa...

09:32.113 --> 09:35.283
It should've been me, not Eren...

09:35.825 --> 09:36.742
I...

09:37.285 --> 09:39.036
wasn't able to do anything!

09:40.246 --> 09:41.622
I'm sorry...

09:45.876 --> 09:46.877
Armin.

09:50.590 --> 09:51.841
Calm down.

09:52.174 --> 09:55.011
This isn't the time to be emotional.

09:56.929 --> 09:58.264
Now get up.

10:00.016 --> 10:01.017
Marco.

10:01.183 --> 10:03.686
If we eliminate the Titans
swarming around HQ,

10:04.061 --> 10:07.440
we can replenish our gas
and get over the wall.

10:07.732 --> 10:08.733
Correct?

10:09.191 --> 10:10.943
Well, yes...

10:11.360 --> 10:14.238
But even with your help,
there's just too many...

10:14.322 --> 10:15.323
I can handle them.

10:15.489 --> 10:16.324
What?

10:17.325 --> 10:19.535
I'm strong.

10:19.952 --> 10:22.246
I'm stronger than all of you.

10:22.747 --> 10:24.081
I'm very strong.

10:24.624 --> 10:29.045
So I am capable of annihilating
the Titans there!

10:29.670 --> 10:31.213
Even if I have to do it alone.

10:33.090 --> 10:35.468
As for all of you,
not only are you unskilled,

10:36.052 --> 10:37.803
but you're also cowards and wimps.

10:39.472 --> 10:41.015
You're a real disappointment.

10:41.474 --> 10:43.768
You can just stay here
and twiddle your thumbs.

10:44.185 --> 10:45.519
Twiddle and watch.

10:45.978 --> 10:48.981
Whoa, Mikasa! What has gotten into you?

10:49.148 --> 10:52.151
You're seriously going to take on
all those Titans by yourself?

10:52.234 --> 10:53.944
There's no way you can beat them!

10:54.028 --> 10:56.030
If I can't, then I'll die.
It's that simple.

10:56.781 --> 10:57.698
But...

10:57.782 --> 10:58.991
If I win, I'll live.

10:59.158 --> 11:01.035
And the only way to win is to fight!

11:02.870 --> 11:03.788
Hey!

11:08.626 --> 11:11.754
Your way with words
is the real disappointment.

11:12.046 --> 11:14.382
You actually considered
that motivational...

11:15.174 --> 11:17.718
This is all your damn fault, Eren!

11:18.427 --> 11:22.640
Hey! Since when were we taught
to let our comrades fight alone?

11:22.890 --> 11:25.768
Or do you guys want
to end up as actual cowards?

11:26.477 --> 11:28.479
I never thought I would hear him say that.

11:35.152 --> 11:39.115
Come on, you cowards,
you weaklings, you morons!

11:39.865 --> 11:41.075
Those guys...

11:41.158 --> 11:42.535
Damn it...

11:42.785 --> 11:44.662
All right, let's do it!

11:53.337 --> 11:54.338
Hurry!

11:54.505 --> 11:56.006
Follow Mikasa!

11:56.340 --> 11:57.800
Fight as little as possible!

11:58.008 --> 12:00.386
Get to HQ before you run out of gas!

12:01.637 --> 12:03.806
Man, Mikasa's incredible...

12:04.181 --> 12:06.350
How can she move so fast?

12:06.976 --> 12:09.520
No! She's using up too much gas!

12:10.062 --> 12:11.897
She's going to run out in no time!

12:12.356 --> 12:13.732
Regardless of our skill,

12:13.816 --> 12:16.235
once we lose our mobility,
we're completely helpless!

12:24.076 --> 12:26.162
She's not her usual, composed self at all!

12:26.829 --> 12:29.081
She's trying to distract herself
from her anguish!

12:29.623 --> 12:31.959
It's only a matter of time until she...

12:37.006 --> 12:38.090
Mikasa!

12:38.507 --> 12:39.550
Damn!

12:39.717 --> 12:40.718
Jean!

12:40.885 --> 12:42.428
You take the lead!

12:42.511 --> 12:43.888
I'll help Armin!

12:44.263 --> 12:45.890
- No, I will too!
- Don't be stupid!

12:45.973 --> 12:47.558
There are still Titans everywhere!

12:47.808 --> 12:49.810
Your skills are needed!

13:03.365 --> 13:04.366
Again...

13:05.326 --> 13:06.702
It's this again...

13:08.913 --> 13:10.956
I've lost my family again.

13:17.087 --> 13:20.799
Do I have to relive this pain...

13:21.634 --> 13:25.304
and start all over again?

13:35.105 --> 13:38.192
It's no use. We can't even get near HQ.

13:39.151 --> 13:41.445
Unless we're prepared to die...

13:47.368 --> 13:49.411
Crap! He's out of gas!

13:51.413 --> 13:52.414
Stay back!

13:53.457 --> 13:55.125
- Tom! I'll save you!
- No!

13:55.209 --> 13:56.752
- That idiot!
- It's too late!

13:58.921 --> 14:00.214
Stop!

14:10.808 --> 14:12.351
Why couldn't I stop them?

14:16.939 --> 14:18.774
Why didn't I stop them?

14:19.275 --> 14:23.028
If I had made them stop,
this wouldn't have happened...

14:28.409 --> 14:30.327
Am I really cut out for this?

14:31.620 --> 14:34.665
Am I really fit to have
a position of responsibility?

14:40.754 --> 14:42.965
No! You can't be serious!

14:55.769 --> 14:58.063
This world is cruel.

14:58.939 --> 14:59.940
And...

15:01.108 --> 15:02.568
very beautiful.

15:09.199 --> 15:11.243
I've lived a good life.

15:36.977 --> 15:37.811
What?

15:42.107 --> 15:43.108
Why?

15:46.111 --> 15:47.988
I was sure I had given up...

15:55.120 --> 15:58.374
Why am I standing up?

15:59.792 --> 16:01.418
Why am I struggling?

16:10.844 --> 16:12.012
What for?

16:13.973 --> 16:15.265
After all...

16:17.434 --> 16:19.311
there's no point in living anymore...

16:20.229 --> 16:21.814
So what is driving me?

16:27.277 --> 16:28.445
Fight!

16:29.029 --> 16:31.240
Fight!

16:32.574 --> 16:33.575
Eren...

16:34.702 --> 16:36.078
Fight!

16:36.787 --> 16:38.706
You have to fight!

16:38.789 --> 16:39.790
Fight!

16:40.082 --> 16:41.583
Fight!

16:44.545 --> 16:46.046
I'm sorry, Eren...

16:47.089 --> 16:49.133
I won't give up anymore.

16:52.094 --> 16:53.804
I'll never give up again.

16:55.848 --> 16:57.599
If I die,

16:58.308 --> 17:01.103
I'll lose my memories of you too,
on top of everything else.

17:02.271 --> 17:03.313
So,

17:03.772 --> 17:05.691
I'll do whatever it takes to win!

17:05.774 --> 17:07.693
Whatever it takes to live!

17:25.002 --> 17:26.253
What just happened?

17:47.649 --> 17:48.817
A Titan...

17:50.069 --> 17:51.612
is killing...

17:53.572 --> 17:54.823
another Titan.

18:19.348 --> 18:20.474
Please, Mikasa!

18:20.974 --> 18:22.101
Be all right!

18:26.522 --> 18:27.439
Mikasa!

18:38.408 --> 18:40.577
Mikasa! Are you all right?

18:41.120 --> 18:42.996
- You two okay?
- Yes!

18:43.413 --> 18:44.915
We've got to get out of here!

18:48.085 --> 18:50.462
Crap! Two 15-meter ones!

18:51.088 --> 18:53.132
No, that Titan is...

19:41.555 --> 19:43.682
It finished off the other one?

19:43.891 --> 19:45.934
It was actually aware
of the Titans' weak spot?

19:46.435 --> 19:47.603
We've got to get out of here!

19:47.936 --> 19:49.396
Before it comes this way!

19:49.479 --> 19:51.773
No, it's not reacting to us.

19:52.482 --> 19:54.693
Any other Titan
would attack us for sure...

19:56.153 --> 19:58.864
It seemed to grasp the concept
of hand-to-hand combat too.

19:59.406 --> 20:00.657
Just what is it?

20:01.158 --> 20:02.910
All we can do is chalk it up
as an Abnormal!

20:03.535 --> 20:05.704
We barely know
anything about them, after all.

20:06.330 --> 20:07.956
Now, let's just hurry to HQ!

20:08.332 --> 20:10.959
Wait! Mikasa's completely out of gas!

20:11.668 --> 20:12.502
What?

20:12.586 --> 20:13.670
Hey, are you serious?

20:13.754 --> 20:15.672
What are we going to do? We need you!

20:16.673 --> 20:18.008
The answer's obvious!

20:18.508 --> 20:20.344
I don't have much left...

20:21.178 --> 20:22.930
but hurry and switch yours with mine!

20:23.263 --> 20:24.097
Armin!

20:24.431 --> 20:25.849
This is our only option!

20:26.516 --> 20:28.685
There's no sense in me having it.

20:29.353 --> 20:30.187
Just...

20:31.271 --> 20:33.357
use it carefully this time.

20:34.107 --> 20:35.859
Everyone's lives are riding on it.

20:38.320 --> 20:43.450
I took charge without any sense
of responsibility for their lives.

20:44.159 --> 20:48.622
For a short time,
I had even thrown away my own life.

20:49.122 --> 20:51.166
All for my own personal reasons.

20:53.502 --> 20:54.711
I'm...

20:55.796 --> 20:56.630
There!

20:57.506 --> 21:00.968
Your mobility gear still works,
and I've given you all my blades.

21:01.468 --> 21:05.013
All I ask is that you leave me
with this one.

21:06.181 --> 21:10.394
I would rather not get eaten alive
if I can.

21:16.483 --> 21:18.151
No way...

21:19.486 --> 21:20.487
Armin.

21:23.323 --> 21:25.242
I'm not leaving you here.

21:35.711 --> 21:36.753
Back then...

21:39.089 --> 21:41.049
I was completely confused.

21:42.175 --> 21:46.263
I had never heard of a Titan
killing another Titan before.

21:48.807 --> 21:52.102
But I also felt
a faint glimmer of elation.

21:53.562 --> 21:55.022
Because what I saw...

21:58.483 --> 22:01.653
looked like the manifestation
of humankind's anger.

23:42.087 --> 23:44.005
A Titan that kills other Titans.

23:44.589 --> 23:50.220
The sight of it leaves the 104th Cadet
Corps Class awestruck and breathless.

23:50.929 --> 23:54.599
What ultimately appeared
before them, though, was...
